WEBVTT

00:26.554 --> 00:27.724
I'm home.

00:27.724 --> 00:29.084
Welcome back!

00:31.094 --> 00:32.064
What?

00:32.064 --> 00:35.254
Today's August 20th. What day is that?

00:44.404 --> 00:47.134
Come on, let's go eat some good food!

00:47.674 --> 00:50.204
H-hey, wait a minute. My bag!

00:56.184 --> 00:59.344
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

01:00.794 --> 01:04.454
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

01:06.064 --> 01:10.294
People will always pursue such things.

01:11.364 --> 01:14.734
And before long, become lost.

01:20.814 --> 01:25.214
This is our story of one such summer.

01:43.604 --> 01:45.034
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:45.034 --> 01:48.704
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
The children's graffiti

01:48.704 --> 01:49.174
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:49.474 --> 01:53.134
That has blossomed on the asphalt

01:53.914 --> 01:57.534
Shimmers in the waves of heat

01:58.384 --> 02:01.214
And has begun to walk

02:01.354 --> 02:06.184
At that promised hill

02:06.184 --> 02:09.814
That no one knows

02:10.364 --> 02:15.064
Encounter the miraculous time called "today"

02:15.064 --> 02:19.834
That comes only once - feel it

02:19.834 --> 02:24.004
Chase the flowing clouds

02:24.004 --> 02:28.344
Even now, they seem in your grasp

02:28.344 --> 02:32.714
A premonition, heart beating with excitement

02:32.714 --> 02:37.344
A destiny that has begun to move

02:37.454 --> 02:41.824
So bright that you awaken

02:41.824 --> 02:45.854
Hotter even than the morning sun

02:46.094 --> 02:49.994
Sparkling without end

02:50.334 --> 02:57.634
Embraced in the season of light

03:00.004 --> 03:01.534
August
20

03:02.974 --> 03:04.034
Here!

03:06.954 --> 03:09.614
Come on now, please hurry!

03:11.654 --> 03:14.624
Okay, if you don't get a move on, you'll be late!

03:15.424 --> 03:17.224
All right then, I'll be back.

03:17.864 --> 03:18.954
See you later.

03:19.594 --> 03:21.124
See you later!

03:22.964 --> 03:24.904
Just what are you planning?

03:27.404 --> 03:31.534
A Moment Between Them

03:31.974 --> 03:34.604
Today is Hiro's birthday!

03:35.744 --> 03:36.574
Really?

03:36.884 --> 03:38.084
Yes!

03:38.084 --> 03:43.144
But he hasn't once remembered
his own birthday.

03:43.414 --> 03:45.354
Even this morning, nothing at all...

03:46.254 --> 03:47.794
Yeah, that's how he is.

03:47.794 --> 03:48.624
Huh?

03:48.624 --> 03:50.924
Uh, nothing. So, what?

03:50.924 --> 03:53.724
You're going to surprise him with a present?

03:53.964 --> 03:55.054
Yes!

03:56.594 --> 04:01.554
A present for your big brother? Hmm...

04:01.904 --> 04:04.104
I was thinking about baking him a cake.

04:04.974 --> 04:06.704
A homemade birthday cake!

04:07.644 --> 04:09.874
Also, um...

04:10.214 --> 04:12.804
Well, the thing is...

04:14.784 --> 04:18.654
Could you please let me use your apartment?

04:31.964 --> 04:33.574
Thank you very much!

04:33.574 --> 04:37.544
Kanocho
Public Library

04:37.544 --> 04:38.604
Cooking

04:38.604 --> 04:42.204
Cooking
I've thought for the longest time
that I wanted to try making a cake, but...

04:44.714 --> 04:45.004
Cooking

04:46.484 --> 04:47.884
Please
be quiet
in the
library

04:47.884 --> 04:48.974
Please
be quiet
in the
library
How about this one?

04:50.324 --> 04:52.484
Baking Your
First Cake

04:52.484 --> 04:53.384
Sponge
Cake

04:53.384 --> 04:54.694
Sponge
Cake
Um...

04:54.694 --> 04:54.924
Um...

04:54.924 --> 04:59.024
Eggs, strawberries and fresh cream...

04:59.024 --> 05:04.764
Say, I don't know if my microwave
can even make a cake.

05:04.764 --> 05:07.094
It has a Bake function, you know.

05:07.234 --> 05:09.834
I've never done anything
but heat things up with it.

05:10.744 --> 05:12.534
I'm telling you, you can bake with it.

05:18.684 --> 05:19.574
Uh...

05:20.314 --> 05:21.544
Yes?

05:21.954 --> 05:24.144
Don't you think we bought a little too much?

05:24.284 --> 05:29.554
But you don't have a measuring cup
or a whisk at your place, so...

05:30.194 --> 05:32.054
Cakes sure are heavy.

05:34.734 --> 05:36.964
Cakes are light!

05:42.034 --> 05:43.944
It's so cool in here!

05:43.944 --> 05:48.074
It'd be better if the three of us just lived here.

05:48.074 --> 05:49.644
We can't!

05:49.644 --> 05:52.044
This is YOUR apartment, Miss Shoko!

05:54.454 --> 05:58.384
It may be mine, but I was turned into a kid
before I even got used to the place.

05:58.924 --> 06:01.084
I haven't even unpacked most of my...

06:01.954 --> 06:04.894
I-I didn't mean anything personal by that!

06:04.894 --> 06:06.194
I'm sorry.

06:06.194 --> 06:10.634
I was the one who wished on the wishing stones,
but then it did this to you...

06:21.814 --> 06:22.704
Here it is!

06:23.214 --> 06:26.674
It's so pretty!

06:26.944 --> 06:29.244
It looks like it works fine as a throw-over, huh?

06:30.354 --> 06:32.254
Feel free to wear it if you like it.

06:32.254 --> 06:33.654
Is that all right?!

06:36.154 --> 06:37.024
Look.

06:37.394 --> 06:38.824
I've got this, too.

07:02.754 --> 07:04.544
This is so much fun!

07:06.254 --> 07:08.724
What are you doing, Miss Shoko?

07:08.954 --> 07:11.294
There's a book that I want to read.

07:11.994 --> 07:14.054
Where did I put it?

07:18.234 --> 07:19.964
Wow...

07:19.964 --> 07:23.334
Miss Shoko, you can even
read books in English?

07:23.704 --> 07:25.604
Because I studied overseas.

07:26.204 --> 07:31.284
What sort of place was it?
The city where you lived in America.

07:31.284 --> 07:34.404
Hiro won't tell me anything about it.

07:42.224 --> 07:47.464
The city I was in is one of the
oldest ones in America,

07:47.464 --> 07:51.904
with buildings made out of brick
and long, winding rivers.

07:52.264 --> 07:53.704
Wow...

07:54.434 --> 07:57.034
And there in the middle of it was a university.

07:57.604 --> 08:01.004
Lots of studying goes on at the university, huh?

08:01.644 --> 08:07.354
That's right. But not just studying.
You can make lots of friends,

08:07.354 --> 08:08.814
and...

08:12.624 --> 08:13.984
And?

08:15.024 --> 08:16.854
Well, lots of different things.

08:21.994 --> 08:25.094
Did you have someone there that you liked,
Miss Shoko?

08:26.164 --> 08:29.974
I mean, you have these wonderful
clothes and accessories

08:29.974 --> 08:33.064
and I'm sure you'd look pretty in them, so...

08:33.974 --> 08:35.234
Yes, there was someone.

08:36.114 --> 08:38.344
What kind of person was he?

08:39.144 --> 08:41.514
A good-for-nothing loser.

08:41.984 --> 08:43.654
Good-for-nothing?

08:43.654 --> 08:45.624
Uh, well, how do I put this?

08:46.684 --> 08:49.594
He was irresponsible and slovenly.

08:49.994 --> 08:52.554
That doesn't sound like a very nice person.

08:53.124 --> 08:55.094
Oh, there's a whole list.

08:55.834 --> 09:00.394
He was self-centered, a liar,
oblivious to other people's feelings...

09:01.774 --> 09:02.734
Yet...

09:03.304 --> 09:04.444
Sasazuka
Pharmacy

09:04.444 --> 09:05.574
Sasazuka
Pharmacy
And yet...

09:05.574 --> 09:05.974
Sasazuka
Pharmacy

09:06.644 --> 09:06.874
Medication

09:06.874 --> 09:10.014
Medication
All right, this comes to one week's worth.

09:10.844 --> 09:15.374
Please have him take one cup of syrup
three times a day following meals.

09:18.854 --> 09:20.254
Thank you for all your help.

09:20.254 --> 09:20.854
Take care.

09:20.854 --> 09:21.124
Bye-bye!
Take care.

09:21.124 --> 09:21.684
Bye-bye!

09:51.054 --> 09:51.844
Here goes!

10:33.964 --> 10:34.964
I'm home.

10:34.964 --> 10:36.484
Welcome back!

10:38.004 --> 10:39.064
What?

10:39.064 --> 10:42.194
Today's August 20th. What day is that?

10:50.014 --> 10:52.244
Um, let's see...

10:52.844 --> 10:57.804
Four eggs, 120 grams of
granulated sugar, cake flour...

10:58.054 --> 11:01.544
120 grams, huh? Also...

11:04.364 --> 11:06.224
Is it okay...

11:06.924 --> 11:08.694
...if I help, too?

11:24.584 --> 11:25.874
Uh, I didn't order this.

11:26.344 --> 11:29.614
It's on the house! It's a special day today, right?

11:29.614 --> 11:32.584
Oh. Yeah. Thank you.

11:32.924 --> 11:37.824
You do a good job of forgetting your
own birthday every year, don't you?

11:38.594 --> 11:42.154
Well, it's better than forgetting your
girlfriend's birthday or something.

11:42.694 --> 11:47.604
I heard from Tetsu.
He said you're living with her.

11:47.604 --> 11:50.234
Huh?! Oh. Yeah...

11:50.804 --> 11:53.534
He said you're taking care of
some relative too, a girl.

11:53.804 --> 11:55.614
Y-yeah.

11:55.614 --> 12:01.514
They've taken in my younger sister,
so we're doing a homestay swap sort of thing.

12:02.854 --> 12:04.254
Sounds like a lot of hassle.

12:04.254 --> 12:08.054
Yeah, uh... Well, we've actually
sort of made it work.

12:09.854 --> 12:11.914
I guess it's only just started working.

12:14.934 --> 12:16.194
How is it?

12:16.194 --> 12:18.664
It's great!

12:18.664 --> 12:20.134
Of course!

12:21.734 --> 12:26.644
Say, I haven't run into that "Shoko" person
at all since the beach. Is she?

12:29.344 --> 12:32.474
Oh gosh, I'm sorry! Are you all right?

12:35.284 --> 12:37.754
I didn't mean anything serious by it.

12:37.754 --> 12:41.394
It's just, I haven't heard from her
at all since then,

12:41.394 --> 12:45.884
and I didn't ask her phone number,
so I really don't...

12:48.334 --> 12:51.764
It'd be best if you went home early today.

12:55.474 --> 12:55.834
Sponge
Cake

12:55.834 --> 13:02.804
Sponge
Cake
Let's see, first we break down the butter,
add cake flour and prep a baking sheet.

13:03.514 --> 13:07.314
Miss Shoko, will you break down
the butter, please?

13:07.614 --> 13:09.114
Break it down?

13:09.114 --> 13:11.714
Dissolve it in hot water.

13:14.754 --> 13:16.914
Okay, thank you!

13:22.264 --> 13:24.454
N-no! Miss Shoko!

13:31.474 --> 13:33.664
But you said to dissolve it in hot water.

13:33.904 --> 13:39.104
No, it means to put the cup with butter in it
into boiling water, so the heat will...

13:39.714 --> 13:44.654
I-I think I'll do it. Miss Shoko,
you add the cake flour, please.

13:54.694 --> 13:56.024
Are you all right?

13:58.734 --> 14:01.724
There's about half of it left, so we're still all right.

14:02.074 --> 14:06.204
Hey, yeah! Miss Shoko, can I have
you slice the strawberries?

14:09.844 --> 14:11.144
I sliced them.

14:13.114 --> 14:14.344
Thank you very m-

14:19.484 --> 14:21.514
I wonder if it's about ready.

14:21.754 --> 14:23.414
Miss Shoko, could you please?

14:23.794 --> 14:25.024
Okay.

14:29.464 --> 14:32.294
Could you add the butter please?

14:35.504 --> 14:37.334
Let me stir, too.

14:37.334 --> 14:38.734
Go ahead.

14:40.404 --> 14:43.374
It says to stir gently, clockwise.

14:44.344 --> 14:45.814
Like this?

14:45.814 --> 14:48.114
That's right! You're doing great!

14:50.854 --> 14:53.154
This takes a bit of elbow grease, doesn't it?

14:53.154 --> 14:54.524
It sure does.

15:04.264 --> 15:06.004
Thank you for all your help!

15:06.004 --> 15:07.774
I'm sorry.

15:07.774 --> 15:13.034
I was no help at all. That'll teach me
to do things I'm no good at.

15:14.474 --> 15:16.444
The fun part is yet to come!

15:16.874 --> 15:20.814
Once the sponge cake is done, we can
decorate it with strawberries and fresh-

15:38.164 --> 15:40.934
Well, it's just, you didn't have to do so much.

15:47.444 --> 15:49.814
Coming out to a fancy place like this...

15:49.814 --> 15:53.944
What's wrong with that? It's a special occasion.
Didn't you like it?

15:55.214 --> 15:57.514
That's not it.

15:57.514 --> 16:00.974
I just would've been fine with
your home cooking or something.

16:02.124 --> 16:05.454
Say, what would you like for a present?

16:05.594 --> 16:06.994
A present, huh?

16:14.164 --> 16:16.104
...Shoko.

16:16.104 --> 16:17.234
Miss Shoko!

16:18.174 --> 16:19.604
Miss Shoko!

16:20.604 --> 16:22.004
Miss Shoko!

16:23.644 --> 16:24.974
It's done!

16:30.954 --> 16:32.884
It looks delicious!

16:32.884 --> 16:34.444
There's still the finishing touch.

16:43.394 --> 16:47.494
Happy
28th
Birthday

16:49.504 --> 16:51.264
I wonder if it tastes all right.

16:51.704 --> 16:55.044
I hope the parts I helped with
didn't turn out weird.

16:57.074 --> 16:59.414
Here. This is for you.

17:00.284 --> 17:03.474
You're always helping me out, so...

17:04.084 --> 17:05.744
Thank you very much!

17:21.104 --> 17:22.364
How is it?

17:31.884 --> 17:33.144
It's delicious!

17:33.644 --> 17:34.674
Right?

17:37.554 --> 17:39.284
Okay, one more bite.

17:47.364 --> 17:50.264
I wonder if this will make Hiro happy.

17:50.594 --> 17:53.964
Don't worry. I guarantee it.

17:56.574 --> 17:58.094
Honestly!

17:59.044 --> 18:02.674
Do you know how many days it's been
since I contacted you?!

18:02.674 --> 18:06.084
It's just, we had the festival and
everything else going on, right?

18:06.084 --> 18:07.984
We've been busy...

18:11.054 --> 18:12.084
Unbelievable!

18:12.084 --> 18:13.184
This is too much.
Unbelievable!

18:13.184 --> 18:16.414
Isn't it, though? Even a prank should have limits!

18:16.624 --> 18:19.114
I just hope nothing bad comes of this.

18:19.294 --> 18:20.784
It must be a prank.

18:23.464 --> 18:24.594
Huh?

18:25.164 --> 18:26.824
We meet again.

18:27.034 --> 18:29.594
Uh, um... Did something happen?

18:29.834 --> 18:34.864
Oh, that? It's nothing, just some prank.

18:35.374 --> 18:38.814
It looks like someone traded out
the wishing stones for charcoal.

18:39.244 --> 18:43.744
Since way back when, those stones have been
said to grant people's wishes...

18:44.154 --> 18:46.784
But they've never once granted any of mine!

18:47.684 --> 18:51.924
Talk about getting worked up over nothing.
It's just some old wives' tale.

18:52.294 --> 18:54.934
Adults sure have a lot of free time.

18:54.934 --> 18:56.164
Let's go.

18:56.164 --> 18:57.094
Okay.

18:57.864 --> 18:58.924
Hey!

19:00.804 --> 19:02.394
Have you made any friends?

19:18.684 --> 19:21.014
It's strange even to me, but...

19:21.824 --> 19:24.224
I just automatically pointed to her.

19:32.464 --> 19:35.464
Happy
28th
Birthday

19:41.314 --> 19:42.844
Congratulations!

19:42.844 --> 19:43.974
Thank you very much.

19:43.974 --> 19:45.344
Why is it?

19:46.284 --> 19:50.744
Why, from the bottom of my heart,
can I now wish this person the best?

19:51.454 --> 19:53.584
Why can I laugh like this?

19:53.584 --> 19:53.924
Thank you.
Why can I laugh like this?

19:53.924 --> 19:54.444
Thank you.

19:56.954 --> 19:57.794
Why?

19:57.794 --> 19:58.124
It's delicious.
Why?

19:58.124 --> 19:58.854
It's delicious.

20:00.064 --> 20:00.094
I'm glad!

20:00.094 --> 20:01.134
I'm glad!
It must be because of...

20:01.134 --> 20:01.754
It must be because of...

20:09.574 --> 20:11.204
I'm going to go buy some cigarettes.

20:11.204 --> 20:13.144
Oh, I'll go with you.

20:20.444 --> 20:21.744
Sorry to keep you waiting.

20:27.354 --> 20:28.514
You know...

20:30.654 --> 20:32.384
I helped out, too.

20:34.594 --> 20:35.994
With the cake.

20:36.594 --> 20:37.564
Oh.

20:38.134 --> 20:39.364
Also...

20:39.364 --> 20:40.764
Hm?

20:41.374 --> 20:42.464
She's a good girl, isn't she?

20:44.374 --> 20:45.704
Karada.

20:45.944 --> 20:47.134
Yeah.

20:48.174 --> 20:49.504
Yes...

20:53.814 --> 20:55.244
She's a good girl.

21:23.014 --> 21:25.984
Welcome!
To
Kanocho

21:56.214 --> 22:00.584
Normal

22:13.894 --> 22:20.134
Wearing unfamiliar shoes

22:20.134 --> 22:24.864
Each step a pain that I endure

22:26.304 --> 22:32.584
And yet I walk

22:32.584 --> 22:37.384
Because I have a place to return to

22:38.154 --> 22:46.294
I stare at myself

22:46.294 --> 22:50.894
And notice something I'd lost

22:54.034 --> 23:00.204
I want to be with you

23:00.204 --> 23:06.914
To feel it, near and far

23:06.914 --> 23:12.784
To keep creating each normal day

23:12.784 --> 23:19.424
With you, my beloved

23:19.424 --> 23:26.854
To say "I'm home,"
remove my shoes and hold you

23:27.104 --> 23:31.934
My sweet home

23:43.914 --> 23:47.324
Sooner or later, I thought this day would come.

23:47.924 --> 23:52.294
That sooner or later, this happiness
would all fall apart.

23:52.624 --> 23:55.494
I'm sorry all I did was rely on you.

23:55.634 --> 24:01.694
Please forgive me for keeping it a secret...
Where I really am.

24:01.874 --> 24:04.534
But now, going forward, I'm sure that...

24:05.644 --> 24:07.544
Next time, on Living for the Day After Tomorrow:

24:07.544 --> 24:08.774
Next episode
Living for the Day After Tomorrow
Next time, on Living for the Day After Tomorrow:

24:08.774 --> 24:10.614
Next episode
Living for the Day After Tomorrow
"Living for the Day After Tomorrow"

24:10.614 --> 24:11.904
Next episode
